      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head>Wer 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">7 riht is, ðæt se slaga, siððan he weres beweddod hæbbe, finde ðærto wærborh, be þam ðe ðærto gebyrige: ðæt is æt twelfhyndum were gebyriað twelf men to werborge, VIII fæderenmægðe 7 IIII medrenmægðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">It is the law that the killer, after he has pledged the wergeld, should find wergeld-surety for it: that is for a twelve-hundred shilling wergeld, twelve men are appropriate as wergeld surety, eight from the paternal kin and four from the maternal.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 riht is, þæt se slaga, syððan he weres beweddod hæbbe, finde ðærto wærborh, be ðam ðe ðærto gebyrige: þæt is æt twelfhyndum were gebyriað XII men to werborge, VIII fæderenmægðe 7 IIII medrenmægðe.</ab>
      </div>
